Z||000030||Boomtastic||08-21-2001||08:40 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Bazooka:<BR><B> *****************************************<BR>Bommtastic,   That sounds like a great setup. Hope to see some pics in the future. Is the weight similar to a regular GT? I know that various V8 Fieros (like my own) Do encounter problems with Transes, Harnessing Power, Suspension, Cooling system Problems and Access problems. It sounds like you may have bypassed a lot of these problems by designing your Fiero as you did. And street legal, wow! You may need wheelie bars to keep it on the road. Nice! </B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Can't quite tell what the weight distribution is/will be, but I'm sure it will be quite different than normal.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> All the problems you mentioned have been eliminated. (I forgot to mention that the harness that runs the TPI setup is from Painless Wiring) Street legal - yes. The only thing missing is windshield wipers. Everything else (lights, signals, headlamps, radio &lt;g&gt;, etc.) work. Wheelie bars are already on it!<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/wheelie_bars_1.jpg"> <P>------------------<BR>Boomtastic<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/mirror_md_clr.gif"> ||||reg||1
Z||000031||Dave Gunsul||08-21-2001||09:58 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by The Fieromaster:<BR><B> DAVE you bad little monkey! Is that why my postman kept chanting "Must work on GT must work on GT"?  He scared the hell outta me!<P></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>||||reg||10
Z||000032||Dave Gunsul||08-21-2001||10:01 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by The Fieromaster:<BR><B> DAVE you bad little monkey! Is that why my postman kept chanting "Must work on GT must work on GT"?  He scared the hell outta me!<P></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Is that what your postman says? I wish mine would say something like that. Mine keeps muttering something about being disgruntled<BR>and someday they'll all pay.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P><P>------------------<BR>Dave Gunsul<BR>N.I.F.E. member<BR>86 GT modified<BR>85 SE daily driver||||reg||10
